#: .\agente\admin.py:41 .\agente\models.py:62 .\agente\models.py:242
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "服务商"

#: .\agente\admin.py:43
msgid ""
"For a local Ollama provider, prefer small models with native tool-calling "
"support and no hidden reasoning (e.g. \"functiongemma\", \"qwen2.5:3b-"
"instruct\", \"llama3.2:3b\") if you don't have a GPU. Reasoning models — the "
"whole Qwen3 family (including \"-vl\" variants), DeepSeek-R1, etc. — "
"generate a long hidden \"thinking\" block before every answer and can take "
"one to two minutes per turn on CPU, sometimes exhausting the token limit "
"before producing any visible text. For OpenAI, \"Detect models\" only lists "
"actual chat models (voice/image/embedding/legacy ones are hidden) and marks "
"a suggested default — \"gpt-4o-mini\" is a solid balance of cost, speed and "
"tool-calling quality for this kind of assistant; reach for \"gpt-4o\"/"
"\"gpt-4.1\" only if you hit quality issues."
msgstr ""
"如果使用本地 Ollama 且没有 GPU，建议选择支持原生工具调用、没有隐藏推理过程的"
"小模型（例如“functiongemma”、“qwen2.5:3b-instruct”、“llama3.2:3b”）。推理模型"
"（整个 Qwen3 系列，包括“-vl”版本、DeepSeek-R1 等）每次回答前都会生成很长的隐"
"藏“思考”内容，在 CPU 上每轮可能需要一到两分钟，有时还没输出可见文字就用完了令"
"牌上限。对于 OpenAI，“检测模型”只列出真正的对话模型（语音/图像/嵌入/旧版模型"
"已隐藏），并标出推荐默认值——“gpt-4o-mini”在成本、速度和工具调用质量之间平衡良"
"好；只有遇到质量问题时才考虑“gpt-4o”/“gpt-4.1”。"

