#: .\agente\models.py:97
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "超时（秒）"

#: .\agente\models.py:99
msgid ""
"Maximum time to wait for a single provider call. Small local models on CPU "
"(especially reasoning models such as Qwen3) can easily take one to two "
"minutes — keep this high for local providers, lower it for fast paid APIs."
msgstr ""
"单次调用服务商的最长等待时间。CPU 上的本地小模型（尤其是 Qwen3 等推理模型）很"
"容易需要一到两分钟——本地服务商请设高一些，快速的付费 API 可以设低一些。"

#: .\agente\models.py:106
msgid "Disable extended reasoning"
msgstr "关闭扩展推理"

#: .\agente\models.py:108
msgid ""
"Appends \"/no_think\" to the system prompt. Only has an effect on models "
"that honor that convention (Qwen3 and similar reasoning models). These "
"models generate a long hidden \"thinking\" block before every answer by "
"default, which can take a minute or more on CPU — enable this for a much "
"faster, more direct assistant at the cost of some reasoning quality."
msgstr ""
"在系统提示词末尾添加“/no_think”。只对遵守该约定的模型有效（Qwen3 及类似推理模"
"型）。这些模型默认在每次回答前生成很长的隐藏“思考”内容，在 CPU 上可能需要一分"
"钟以上——开启后助手会快很多、更直接，但推理质量会有所下降。"

